  rules:
  - title: Call a number you looked up yourself
    text: Unsure? Hang up and call the number on your card or the official website,
      not the number the caller gives you.
    learnedOn: Seoul Daily, 6 Oct
  - title: Read the name on the account
    text: Before you send money, check the account holder's name on the transfer
      screen. A person's name on an 'official' account is a red flag.
    learnedOn: Seoul Daily, 6 Oct
